From bad52f03987de91d41c232c72836237d6ae3324d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: iberi22 <10615454+iberi22@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 07:49:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: implement controlled propagation deep federated search

- Define FederatedSearchRequest struct in src/memory/schema.rs
- Add federated options to MemoryQueryFilters and MemoryQueryPayload
- Refactor memory_query_handler and query_workspace_handler to support local_dbs filtering, propagate_to_mesh/peer_nodes routing, and max_hops propagation depth control with cycle prevention
- Enrich search results with source_node_id and source_db_id
- Add integration tests for FederatedSearchRequest serialization/deserialization
